OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FThere will
OL,6,Fbe further outbreaks of rain, heavy at
OL,7,Ftimes and accompanied by gusty winds
OL,8,Fthroughout this evening and overnight.
OL,9,FSevere gales over the Hebrides later.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTuesday:FIt will be another very
OL,12,Funsettled day with further spells of
OL,13,Fheavy rain. Southwesterly winds will
OL,14,Fbe very strong with severe gales for a
OL,15,Ftime.
OL,16,
OL,17,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FA
OL,18,Fmuch quieter end to the week with some
OL,19,Fshowers at times but also dry and
OL,20,Fbright weather. Still rather breezy,
OL,21,Fespecially in the west.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
